  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooperative Agreement with Tuskegee University, 10-5000-2061-CA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Under the Tuskegee - APHIS Cooperative Agreement for international capacity building, Tuskegee University conducted a two-week advanced Risk Analysis workshop for participants from several countries in West Africa. This workshop built on the first basic Risk Analysis workshop conducted in August 2010. This workshop was held at the Erata Hotel in Accra, Ghana. The objective of the workshop was to deepen the understanding and practice related to Risk Analysis as it relates to specific agricultural commodities that the representative countries in the workshop are interested in trading. One representative from APHIS PPD attended the workshop.</narrative>
  </description>
